    { "type": "text", "id": "b2b_eyebrow", "label": "Eyebrow", "default": "The follow-on" },
    { "type": "text", "id": "b2b_title", "label": "Heading", "default": "A bike that goes home." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "b2b_body_1", "label": "Paragraph 1", "default": "The most engaged participants progress to Build to Bond — building a children's bamboo balance bike to gift to their own son, daughter, niece or nephew. That bike they keep. The bike goes home; the father stays inside." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "b2b_body_2", "label": "Paragraph 2", "default": "It's built on the evidence that maintaining family contact is one of the strongest predictors of reduced reoffending — prisoners who keep close family ties are 39% less likely to reoffend (Lord Farmer Review, 2017)." },
    { "type": "textarea", "id": "b2b_quote", "label": "Pull quote", "default": "Watching the pride on a father's face when he presents a bike to his child is something special." },
    { "type": "text", "id": "b2b_cite", "label": "Quote attribution", "default": "— Sally Allsopp, Industries Manager" },
